CHAPTER II
FORMS OF VIOLENCE
Article 5
Forms of Violence against Women and Children include:
a. Physical violence;
b. Psychological violence;
c. Sexual violence;
d. Domestic neglect;
e. Exploitation;
f. Human trafficking; and/or
g. other violence.

